: "44630697", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095367811", "personaname": "Koz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095367811/", "num_games_owned": 376, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4040, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 817, "last_played": 1723981283, "avatar": "ad14f68bcd5dd937730f453fccffbe2ee4934430"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely amazing game. i generally dont like these 'fight/run to a point' types of games that much, but this one is really fun. The devs have done a great job with the mining system and have made it so satisfying to do, topped off with some decent combat and you have yourself this great experience. even when I get absolutely demolished and lose like 3 times in a row I still cant help but go back in and try again with full optimism and enjoyment. class synergy is also very well done, e.g. engineer can shoot platforms onto walls that the scout can then grapple to and mine hard to reach resources. they've even accomadated for single player as well so dont be too daunted by the very prominent co-op push of the game, although it is so much more fun with atleast 1 other person.", "timestamp_created": 1536406436, "timestamp_updated": 1536406436, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.521531105041503906", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}